					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm changing my +1 to a novote on this one. It is funny, but 90% of the joke is <a href="https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/54d6e1fa-2321-451f-9390-2afbdfe21b5d/d37bqoo-685e0dab-6db3-4722-b0b2-f36c8c2ab924.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..D7ODcm6CEHxMiPEWer-FbagAXpxep0Tg_FprX1ctIqw">just taken from a meme.</a> Knowing that, it makes the punchline of this feel a little cheap. Like it's repackaging the same joke in an SCP format.</p> 
				 	]]>
